<title>INDIA: India produced 3,236 tonnes lead in April.</title>
<headline>India produced 3,236 tonnes lead in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 3,236 tonnes of lead in April 1997, up from 2,786 in April 1996, the government said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed	     Production</p>
<p>	   capacity    April 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>	   (annual)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>HZL	 65,000     2,367	   1,440</p>
<p>ILL</p>
<p>Secondary 24,000	 869	   1,346</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Total     89,000     3,236	   2,786</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91 11 301 2024</p>
</text>
